          "responses": [
            {
              "feedback": {
                "content": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Correct. The basicity of the anions in a series of acids will be the opposite of the acidity in their oxyacids. The acidity increases as the electronegativity of the central atom increases. Cl is more electronegative than Br, and I is the least electronegative of the three."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "jcr9tie8kfyxpru",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "237147164"
              },
              "id": "2637899132",
