                "content": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Incorrect. The basicity of the anions in a series of acids will be the opposite of the acidity in their oxyacids. Higher electronegativity results in weaker acidity and stronger basicity."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "630cqcicd5txt90",
